===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|nl|dum|stellen}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|*stellen}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|nl}} {{m|gem-pro|*stallijaną}}. More at {{l|en|stell}}.

====Verb====
{{nl-verb|stelde|gesteld}}

# to [[position]]; place
# to [[state]], to put forward
# {{label|nl|passive}} gesteld zijn op: to feel affection for
# {{qualifier|zich stellen}} to take one's stand
# {{label|nl|chemistry}} to [[standardize]] a solution by titration

